node_modules/
/.npmrc
picar-cfg.local.json
/node_modules*/
/bin/
mediamtx.yml
mav.tlog
*.tlog
# MAVProxy writes mav.tlog.raw alongside mav.tlog, and *.tlog does not match it —
# so the raw log was tracked in git for months despite the rule against committing
# tlogs. Same for parameter dumps: mav.parm was tracked, and it was a PX4
# quadcopter dump, not rover3's ArduRover baseline (see the removal commit).
# Deliberately NOT "not this fleet": the fleet runs both firmwares — rover1's
# Pixhawk 6C was converted and runs PX4 — so a PX4 dump is foreign to rover3, not
# to the fleet, and treating PX4 as necessarily alien is its own mistake.
*.tlog.raw
*.parm
*.param
